WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Download the package for your browser from the Claritas website.

2
00:06.000 --> 00:11.000
Unzip it into a folder.

3
00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
Open the extensions page: chrome://extensions (edge://extensions, opera://extensions…).

4
00:17.000 --> 00:21.000
Turn on Developer mode.

5
00:22.000 --> 00:29.000
Choose “Load unpacked” and select the folder.

6
00:30.000 --> 00:37.000
Claritas appears in the list. Pin it to the toolbar.

7
00:38.000 --> 00:43.000
Open the Claritas popup from the toolbar. Done.
